      "rationale": "Reformat-only (no FX conversion) \u2014 amounts are unchanged numbers, only symbol + grouping change. Currency lives per household on households.currency because the data model already has a household tenant; React Context (CurrencyProvider) avoids prop-drilling and preserves the formatCurrency(amount) call shape. Default INR with the en-IN locale for correct lakh/crore grouping (\u20b91,50,000.00)."
